REGENT OF NORTH LAMPUNG

REGENT OF NORTH LAMPUNG

REGIONAL REGULATION OF NORTH LAMPUNG REGENCY

NUMBER 1 OF 2017

REGARDING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF NORTH LAMPUNG,

Considering : a. that women and children have the right to obtain a sense of security and freedom from all forms of torture or treatment that degrades human dignity, therefore they need to receive optimal legal protection;

b. that based on Article 9 paragraph (3) and paragraph (4), and Article

12 paragraph (2) letter b of Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government, it is stated that women's empowerment and child protection are mandatory government affairs not related to basic services of the government and are the responsibility of the North Lampung Regency government;

c. that based on the considerations in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women's Empowerment and Protection of Children from Acts of Violence

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

2. Law Number 28 of 1959 concerning Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 4 of 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1956 Number 55) and

Emergency Law Number 6 of 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1956 Number 57) concerning Establishment of Level II Regions including Municipal Cities Within the Level I Region of South Sumatra as Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1959 Number 73, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1821);

